  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Resilient, Inclusive Markets in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project (2025 &#x2013; 2029) draws upon the results and lessons learnt of the first phase (2023-2024), with the strategic goal to enhance the national inclusive, competitive, sustainable and resilient economic development, and promote equal access to decent work at the local and (micro)-regional levels. This is to be achieved by improving regulatory frameworks and business support services, as well as leveraging enhanced multi-stakeholder business cooperation, targeting local population and return</narrative>
  </description>
